## Knowledge Routing
When working on → Read first:
- Any project → ~/.claude/knowledge/qualia-context.md
- Supabase/DB → ~/.claude/knowledge/supabase-patterns.md
- Deploying → ~/.claude/knowledge/deployment-map.md
- Voice agents → ~/.claude/knowledge/voice-agent-patterns.md
- Sakani → ~/.claude/skills/sakani-conventions/SKILL.md
- Debugging/errors → ~/.claude/knowledge/common-fixes.md
- Past mistakes → ~/.claude/knowledge/learned-patterns.md
- New employee → ~/Projects/live/qualia/docs/trainee-onboarding.md
- Project checklists → ~/Projects/live/qualia/docs/completion-checklists.md

## Cross-Session Intelligence
- Session digest: ~/.claude/knowledge/session-digest.md (rolling 20-session log across all projects)
- Auto-handoff: .continue-here.md auto-generated when >5 files changed in a session
- Stale knowledge: session-context-loader warns about knowledge files >30 days old
- Project pulse: shows which projects had git activity in last 7 days

## Top Learned Rules
- ALWAYS check `pwd` and read local CLAUDE.md on session start
- ALWAYS use feature branches — branch-guard blocks main pushes
- NEVER expose service_role key in client components
- NEVER use Task(Explore) for simple lookups — use Glob/Grep directly
- ALWAYS run post-deploy verification (HTTP 200, auth, console, latency)

